# PyPI publish (totodev-pub)

Local API tokens (gitignored) live at:

`volatile/credentials/pypi_token_for_project.sh`

That file exports `PYPI_PROJ_TOKEN` (project-scoped, preferred) and `PYPI_DAVEDESK_TOKEN`. Never copy token values into the repo, rules, commits, or chat.

To publish from this workspace:

```bash
source volatile/credentials/pypi_token_for_project.sh
export UV_PUBLISH_TOKEN="$PYPI_PROJ_TOKEN"
uv build
uv publish
```

Do not publish unless the user explicitly asks. CI does not publish.
